  "prefLabel": "Rev 2910.03 Confidentiality",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2910.03 Confidentiality. The department shall not disclose the existence or terms of a voluntary disclosure agreement to any other state or the United States Internal Revenue Service, notwithstanding compacts for the exchange of information.\n\nSource. #11142, eff 7-26-16; ss by #13660, eff 6-21-23",
